Subject: [PATCH] Migrate API foundation from Replit to Vercel serverless +
 Supabase

- Export Express app as a Vercel function (api/index.ts); keep index.ts for
  local dev. Frontend stays same-origin (relative /api), no FE change needed.
- Replace setInterval startup jobs with Vercel Cron endpoints
  (/api/cron/drive-channel-renewal, /api/cron/pending-grants-cleanup,
  /api/cron/seed), authed via CRON_SECRET; export their inner functions.
- vercel.json: all-in serverless (SPA static + api function + crons), drop the
  Railway split-host rewrite.
- DB: serverless-aware pool sizing; drizzle-kit prefers DIRECT_DATABASE_URL
  (Supabase direct 5432) while runtime uses the pooled URL.
- Anthropic client falls back to direct ANTHROPIC_API_KEY off Replit.
- Remove .replit/.replitignore/replit.md; refresh .env.example and claude.md.
- Add MIGRATION.md (setup + open follow-ups: bcrypt->bcryptjs, pdfkit fonts,
  SSE, long backfill) and a Claude Code SessionStart hook.

