+- **Deploy:** push to the connected branch → Vercel builds (`vercel.json`)
+- **Logs:** Vercel dashboard → Functions / Deployments → Logs
+- **DB:** Supabase. Runtime uses the **pooled** URL (`DATABASE_URL`, 6543);
+  migrations use the **direct** URL (`DIRECT_DATABASE_URL`, 5432)
+- **Schema migrations:** run `pnpm --filter @workspace/db run push` (not automatic)
+- **Scheduled jobs:** Vercel Cron → `GET /api/cron/*`, authed with `CRON_SECRET`
 
 ### One-shot admin endpoints (production)
